      "cooked": "<p>How to import specific font in print format like FranklinGothicBookRegular</p>\n<p><span class=\"mention\">@font-face</span> {<br>\nfont-family: “Franklin Gothic Book”;<br>\nsrc: url(“<a href=\"https://midas.m.frappe.cloud/files/FranklinGothicBookRegular.ttf%E2%80%9D\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Frappe Cloud</a>);</p>\n<p>}</p>",
